A new algorithm was developed and the corresponding program was written for generating the  groupoids of small (2, 3, and 4) orders with generalized  Bol-Moufang identities.

Notice, number of groupoids  of order $3$ with mentioned in table identities are also given in \cite{Cernov_2018_2}.

Identities Left Bol and Right Bol, LC- and RC-, LN- and RN-, L2 and L3, M1 and M3, M2 and M4, T1 and T3, T4 and T5, are  $(12)$-parastrophic identitities. Therefore the numbers of  groupoids of fixed order with these $(12)$-parastrophic identitities coincide.


